## Why This Is Asked
Tests multi-source timestamp normalization, Parquet partitioning strategies, and foundational data quality practices—core competencies for entry-level data engineers working with real-world SaaS integrations.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-source timestamp normalization to UTC
- AWS Glue ETL jobs and Data Catalog integration
- Parquet file format with date-based partitioning
- Schema evolution via crawler configuration
- Basic data quality validation and testing frameworks

## Code Example
```javascript
function normalizeTimestamp(ts, formats) {
  // Parse multiple timestamp formats
  for (const format of formats) {
    const parsed = moment(ts, format, true);
    if (parsed.isValid()) {
      return parsed.utc().format();
    }
  }
  throw new Error(`Unable to parse timestamp: ${ts}`);
}
```

